tube TIB4S      TkSupport                      49.9000 +x0:0.03000  -70.0000     70.0000 det=TKSUP layer=4
tube TOB1       G4_Si                          60.8000    +um:1000 -109.0000    109.0000 det=TOB layer=1 sens
tube TOB1S      TkSupport                      60.9500 +x0:0.02000 -109.0000    109.0000 det=TKSUP layer=1
tube TOB2       G4_Si                          69.2000    +um:1000 -109.0000    109.0000 det=TOB layer=2 sens
