tube TOB6S      TkSupport                     108.1500 +x0:0.02000 -109.0000    109.0000 det=TKSUP layer=6
tube TKTUBE     TkSupport                     116.0000 +x0:0.02000 -280.0000    280.0000 det=TKSUP
tube TID1       G4_Si                          20.0000     50.0000   80.0000     +um:320 det=TID layer=1 sens mirror
tube TID1S      TkSupport                      20.0000     50.0000   80.1000 +x0:0.03000 det=TKSUP layer=1 mirror
tube TID2       G4_Si                          20.0000     50.0000   85.0000     +um:320 det=TID layer=2 sens mirror
