tube TEC1       G4_Si                          22.0000    113.5000  127.7500     +um:400 det=TEC layer=1 sens mirror
tube TEC1S      TkSupport                      22.0000    113.5000  127.8500 +x0:0.04000 det=TKSUP layer=1 mirror
tube TEC2       G4_Si                          22.0000    113.5000  141.7500     +um:400 det=TEC layer=2 sens mirror
